{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","震岩轮舞"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","进入“战斗姿态”，拥有更灵活的伤害和逃生手段。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个地图格，蜷缩成球形移动到目标格，对附近1格范围内的敌人造成300% + 20% ATK伤害，随后开启“战斗姿态”，直至战斗结束。“战斗姿态”状态下，可消耗500点能量使用“活跃突进”蜷缩成球撞击目标并回到原本位置，造成260% + 20% ATK伤害并眩晕2秒。另外，当自身受到来自 1 格范围内伤害时，将优先考虑使用“迅疾撤离”蜷缩成球对自身周围1格的敌人造成150% + 5% ATK伤害并降低60%移动速度持续2秒，随后滚动到远离该攻击者的位置，获得最大生命值25%的护盾，持续7秒，该效果至多每7秒生效一次。蜷缩成球期间免疫控制。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":117,"end":123,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":189,"end":194,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":113,"end":127,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":185,"end":198,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“活跃突进”造成的伤害提升至270% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“活跃突进”造成的伤害提升至280% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“活跃突进”造成的伤害提升至290% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","“活跃突进”造成的伤害提升至300% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end